Package: gta
Title: Global Tuna Atlas: Harmonisation and Levels of the Tuna RFMO Datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Bastien", "Grasset", , "bastien.grasset@ird.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9946-1338"))
Description: Business functions of the Global Tuna Atlas: harmonisation of the
    raw datasets of the five tuna Regional Fisheries Management Organisations
    (tRFMOs) to the CWP format, and creation of the nominal catch, level 0,
    level 1, level 2 and effort datasets. The geoflow workflow of this
    repository (workflow/, config/) calls these functions.
